stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT: batch built from a locked payroll month
    DRAFT --> PREFLIGHT_FAILED: a line fails IFSC, account, amount, rail or control totals
    PREFLIGHT_FAILED --> DRAFT: line corrected in the exception worklist
    DRAFT --> READY: every line passes pre-flight and a rail is resolved per line
    READY --> HELD: bank connection expiring, stale or locked out on OTP attempts
    HELD --> READY: tenant re-authenticates, OTP never auto-retried
    READY --> RELEASED: payment approver distinct from the payroll processor releases
    RELEASED --> PENDING_BANK_APPROVAL: the corporate has bank-side approval workflows
    RELEASED --> ACCEPTED_BY_BANK: no bank-side approval configured
    PENDING_BANK_APPROVAL --> ACCEPTED_BY_BANK: named bank approver authorises in the bank portal
    PENDING_BANK_APPROVAL --> REJECTED_BY_BANK: bank approver rejects or the window lapses
    REJECTED_BY_BANK --> DRAFT: batch re-prepared, prior batch retained, never auto re-initiated
    ACCEPTED_BY_BANK --> PARTIALLY_SETTLED: some lines credited, some returned or failed
    ACCEPTED_BY_BANK --> SETTLED: every line credited
    PARTIALLY_SETTLED --> SETTLED: exactly the failed lines re-queued under the same per-line keys
    SETTLED --> RECONCILED: sum credited equals sum net equals sum payslips
    RECONCILED --> [*]

    note right of PENDING_BANK_APPROVAL
        Never described as paid, settled or disbursed
        on any surface
    end note
